Attribution
===========

This package is an independent implementation of the algorithms described in

    A. J. Pan-Collantes, J. A. Alvarez-Garcia,
    "From curvature to Kovacic: a geometric approach to integrability of
    scalar ODEs".

The Kovacic solver follows the classical algorithm of

    J. Kovacic, "An algorithm for solving second order linear homogeneous
    differential equations", J. Symbolic Comput. 2 (1986), 3-43.

The exposition and the public Maple package of

    N. M. Abbasi, "Analysis and object oriented implementation of the
    Kovacic algorithm", arXiv:2211.00804 (2022)

were used as references while writing the SymPy implementation.  The code
here is not a line-by-line translation of that package; all errors are ours.
Users who redistribute this software should satisfy themselves that the
attribution above is appropriate for their use.
